diff --git a/accman/install.md b/accman/install.md
index d7581cf..3c95a97 100644
--- a/accman/install.md
+++ b/accman/install.md
@@ -12,3 +12,27 @@
 
 ## Stop
 - Run `./stop.sh`
+
+## Windows (Windows Server 2019)
+1. Download PHP 8.3 "VS16 x64 Non Thread Safe" (zip) from https://windows.php.net/download/
+   and unzip it to `C:\php`. Add `C:\php` to the system PATH.
+2. Copy `C:\php\php.ini-production` to `C:\php\php.ini` and enable these lines
+   (remove the leading `;`):
+   ```
+   extension_dir = "ext"
+   extension=pdo_mysql
+   ```
+3. Edit `accman\config.php` with your database credentials.
+4. Run `accman\start.bat`, then open `http://localhost:8088`. `accman\stop.bat` stops it.
+5. To reach it from other machines, allow the port (PowerShell as Administrator):
+   `New-NetFirewallRule -DisplayName "Astonia account manager" -Direction Inbound -Protocol TCP -LocalPort 8088 -Action Allow`
+
+PHP's built-in server is fine for a small private server. For a public one, put it
+behind IIS or Apache with HTTPS, because passwords are sent in plain text otherwise.
+
+## Characters
+- Players can create up to 20 characters per account and delete their own.
+- Names are 3-35 letters, the same rule the game server uses, and names in the
+  `badname` table are refused.
+- Deleting asks for the character name to be typed again, and only works while the
+  character is offline.
